ssage to understand what went wrong.",[475,476],"hr",{},[478,479,481],"h2",{"id":480},"status-codes","Status codes",[471,483,484],{},"Here is a list of the different categories of status codes returned by the Vatly API. Use these to understand if a request was successful.",[486,487,488,501],"table",{},[489,490,491],"thead",{},[492,493,494,498],"tr",{},[495,496,497],"th",{},"Status",[495,499,500],{},"Description",[502,503,504,516,526],"tbody",{},[492,505,506,513],{},[507,508,509],"td",{},[510,511,512],"code",{},"2xx",[507,514,515],{},"A 2xx status code indicates a successful response.",[492,517,518,523],{},[507,519,520],{},[510,521,522],{},"4xx",[507,524,525],{},"A 4xx status code indicates a client error. This means there's an issue with the request.",[492,527,528,533],{},[507,529,530],{},[510,531,532],{},"5xx",[507,534,535],{},"A 5xx status code indicates a server error. This means the issue is on Vatly's end and we are automatically notified of the problem.",[537,538,540],"h3",{"id":539},"common-status-codes","Common status codes",[486,542,543,553],{},[489,544,545],{},[492,546,547,550],{},[495,548,549],{},"Code",[495,551,552],{},"Meaning",[502,554,555,565,575,585,595,605,615,625,635,649,659],{},[492,556,557,562],{},[507,558,559],{},[510,560,561],{},"200",[507,563,564],{},"OK - Request succeeded.",[492,566,567,572],{},[507,568,569],{},[510,570,571],{},"201",[507,573,574],{},"Created - Resource was successfully created.",[492,576,577,582],{},[507,578,579],{},[510,580,581],{},"204",[507,583,584],{},"No Content - Request succeeded with no response body (e.g., deletes).",[492,586,587,592],{},[507,588,589],{},[510,590,591],{},"400",[507,593,594],{},"Bad Request - The request was malformed.",[492,596,597,602],{},[507,598,599],{},[510,600,601],{},"401",[507,603,604],{},"Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key.",[492,606,607,612],{},[507,608,609],{},[510,610,611],{},"403",[507,613,614],{},"Forbidden - The API key doesn't have permission for this action.",[492,616,617,622],{},[507,618,619],{},[510,620,621],{},"404",[507,623,624],{},"Not Found - The requested resource doesn't exist.",[492,626,627,632],{},[507,628,629],{},[510,630,631],{},"409",[507,633,634],{},"Conflict - Idempotency mismatch, request still in progress, outcome unknown, a concurrent write, or a refund of the same order already being created.",[492,636,637,642],{},[507,638,639],{},[510,640,641],{},"422",[507,643,644,645,648],{},"Unprocessable Entity - Validation failed. Check the ",[510,646,647],{},"errors"," field for details.",[492,650,651,656],{},[507,652,653],{},[510,654,655],{},"429",[507,657,658],{},"Too Many Requests - Rate limit exceeded. Slow down your requests.",[492,660,661,666],{},[507,662,663],{},[510,664,665],{},"500",[507,667,668],{},"Internal Server Error - Something went wrong on Vatly's end.",[475,670],{},[478,672,674],{"id":673},"error-responses","Error responses",[471,676,677],{},"Whenever a request is unsuccessful, the Vatly API will return an error response with a human-readable message. Combine it with the HTTP status code to understand what has gone wrong and how to fix it. Most of the error messages are pretty helpful and actionable.",[679,680,686],"pre",{"className":681,"code":682,"filename":683,"language":684,"meta":685,"style":685},"language-json shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","{\n  \"message\": \"Resource not found.\"\n}\n","Error response","json","",[510,687,688,697,723],{"__ignoreMap":685},[689,690,693],"span",{"class":691,"line":692},"line",1,[689,694,696],{"class":695},"sMK4o","{\n",[689,698,700,703,707,710,713,716,720],{"class":691,"line":699},2,[689,701,702],{"class":695},"  \"",[689,704,706],{"class":705},"spNyl","message",[689,708,709],{"class":695},"\"",[689,711,712],{"class":695},":",[689,714,715],{"class":695}," \"",[689,717,719],{"class":718},"sfazB","Resource not found.",[689,721,722],{"class":695},"\"\n",[689,724,726],{"class":691,"line":725},3,[689,727,728],{"class":695},"}